@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15

actor "Desenvolvedor React" as Dev
participant "Dashboard Web" as Web
participant "Core API\n(Node.js)" as Core
participant "ProviderFactory" as Factory
participant "IConferenceProvider\n(Strategy)" as Strategy
participant "Banco de Dados" as DB

Dev -> Web: Define API e Parâmetros
activate Web
Web -> Core: POST /api/configurar
activate Core

Core -> Factory: criarProvider(api_tipo)
activate Factory
Factory -> Strategy: instanciar(tipo)
activate Strategy
Strategy --> Factory: Objeto Driver
deactivate Strategy
Factory --> Core: Instância Pronta
deactivate Factory

Core -> DB: INSERT INTO testes (status: 'configurado')
activate DB
DB --> Core: UUID Gerado
deactivate DB

Core --> Web: 201 Created (ID)
deactivate Core
Web --> Dev: Notifica Sucesso
deactivate Web
@enduml